{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1987_q001", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1987", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1987, "question_number": 1, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["导数", "复合函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1987_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1987_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q001.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "$y'=\\dfrac{a}{1+ax}$，$y''=-\\dfrac{a^2}{(1+ax)^2}$", "explanation": "直接求导即可。先得 $y'=a/(1+ax)$，再对其求导，得到 $y''=-a^2/(1+ax)^2$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1987_q002", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1987", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1987, "question_number": 2, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["切线", "法线"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1987_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1987_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q002.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "切线：$y=\\dfrac{1}{2}x+\\dfrac{\\pi-2}{4}$；法线：$y=-2x+\\dfrac{\\pi+8}{4}$", "explanation": "在 $x=1$ 处，点为 $(1,\\pi/4)$，导数 $y'=1/(1+x^2)$，故切线斜率为 $1/2$，法线斜率为 $-2$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1987_q003", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1987", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1987, "question_number": 3, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["积分中值定理"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1987_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1987_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q003.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "条件：$f(x)$ 在闭区间 $[a,b]$ 上连续；结论：存在 $\\xi\\in[a,b]$，使 $\\int_a^b f(x)\\,dx=f(\\xi)(b-a)$", "explanation": "这是积分中值定理的标准表述：连续性是条件，结论是定积分可写成某点函数值与区间长度的乘积。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1987_q004", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1987", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1987, "question_number": 4, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["数列极限"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1987_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1987_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q004.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "$e^{-3}$", "explanation": "写成 $\\left(1-\\dfrac{3}{n+1}\\right)^n$，利用指数极限即可得到 $e^{-3}$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1987_q005", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1987", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1987, "question_number": 5, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["不定积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1987_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1987_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q005.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "$f(x)+C$；$\\dfrac{1}{2}f(2b)-\\dfrac{1}{2}f(2a)$", "explanation": "第一空由原函数定义直接得到。第二空令 $u=2x$，则积分化为 $\\dfrac{1}{2}\\int_{2a}^{2b}f'(u)\\,du$。", "methods": ["换元积分"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1987_q006", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1987", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1987, "question_number": 6, "question_type": "solution", "score": 6, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极限", "泰勒展开"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1987_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1987_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q006.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{1}{2}$", "explanation": "通分后得 $\\dfrac{e^x-1-x}{x(e^x-1)}$。由 $e^x-1-x\\sim x^2/2$、$x(e^x-1)\\sim x^2$ 可知极限为 $1/2$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1987_q007", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1987", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1987, "question_number": 7, "question_type": "solution", "score": 7, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["参数方程", "导数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1987_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1987_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q007.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{dy}{dx}=\\dfrac{\\sin t}{1-\\cos t}$，$\\dfrac{d^2y}{dx^2}=-\\dfrac{1}{5(1-\\cos t)^2}$", "explanation": "由 $dx/dt=5(1-\\cos t)$、$dy/dt=5\\sin t$ 得一阶导，再对其关于 $t$ 求导并除以 $dx/dt$ 得二阶导。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1987_q008", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1987", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1987, "question_number": 8, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["微分方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1987_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1987_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q008.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_002.png"], "answer": "(1) $y=\\dfrac{x}{2}-\\dfrac{1}{x}$；(2) $y=(C_1+C_2x)e^{-x}+\\dfrac{1}{4}(x-1)e^x$", "explanation": "第一问化为一阶线性方程，积分因子为 $x$。第二问齐次方程有二重根 $-1$，再设特解为 $e^x(ax+b)$ 代入求系数。", "methods": ["积分因子"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1987_q009", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1987", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1987, "question_number": 9, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 16, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["函数性质", "奇偶性", "有界性", "导数定义", "伴随矩阵", "行列式"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1987_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1987_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q009.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_002.png"], "answer": "(1) D；(2) D；(3) B；(4) C", "explanation": "(1) $x\\sin x$ 为偶函数，$|x\\sin x|$ 和 $e^{\\cos x}$ 也均为偶函数，所以乘积为偶函数，选 D。\n\n(2) $x\\sin x$ 的振幅随 $|x|$ 增大而增大，在 $(-\\infty,+\\infty)$ 内无界，选 D。\n\n(3)\n$$\n\\frac{f(a+x)-f(a-x)}{x}\n=\\frac{f(a+x)-f(a)}{x}+\\frac{f(a)-f(a-x)}{x}.\n$$\n令 $x\\to0$，两项极限均为 $f'(a)$，故极限为 $2f'(a)$，选 B。\n\n(4) 题卡当前文字为伴随矩阵版本。由\n$$\nA^*=(\\det A)A^{-1}\n$$\n得\n$$\n\\det(A^*)=(\\det A)^n\\det(A^{-1})=a^{n-1},\n$$\n选 C。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1987_q010", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1987", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1987, "question_number": 10, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["最值", "切线"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1987_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1987_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q010.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_002.png"], "answer": "所求点为 $\\left(\\dfrac{\\sqrt{3}}{3},\\dfrac{2}{3}\\right)$，最小面积为 $\\dfrac{4}{9}\\sqrt{3}-\\dfrac{2}{3}$", "explanation": "设切点横坐标为 $a$，写出切线方程，把围成面积化为关于 $a$ 的函数，求导后得极小值点 $a=\\sqrt{3}/3$。", "methods": []}
